    Value: Nobody has a card you have not seen.
  - Key: item.reason.nobody_to_shake
    Value: Nobody is left to shake.
  - Key: item.reason.nobody_to_roll
    Value: Nobody else is left to roll.
  - Key: item.reason.nobody_to_swap
    Value: Nobody else has a card to swap.
  - Key: item.copy_card.name
    Value: Copy
  - Key: item.copy_card.description
    Value: 35% chance that one of your cards becomes a copy of another card in your
      hand.
  - Key: item.copy_card.notice
    Value: TRIED A COPY
  - Key: item.copy_card.copied
    Value: COPIED
  - Key: item.copy_card.failed
    Value: COPY FAILED
  - Key: item.deck_count.name
    Value: Suit Count
  - Key: item.deck_count.description
    Value: See how many cards of each suit, and how many Jokers where the deck has
      them, are still in the undealt deck. Only you see the count, and it stays with
      you until the hand ends.
  - Key: item.deck_count.notice
    Value: COUNTED DECK
  - Key: item.extra_draw.name
    Value: Extra Draw
  - Key: item.extra_draw.description
    Value: Draw one more card from the deck. You cannot fold for the rest of this
      hand.
  - Key: item.extra_draw.notice
    Value: DREW EXTRA
  - Key: item.half_dose.name
    Value: Half Dose
  - Key: item.half_dose.description
    Value: 'Choose a player: their death rate is halved, then they roll against what
      is left.'
  - Key: item.half_dose.notice
    Value: HALVED
  - Key: item.half_dose.prompt
    Value: POINT AT WHOSE DOSE YOU HALVE
  - Key: item.joker_card.name
    Value: Wild Card
  - Key: item.joker_card.description
    Value: 50% chance that a chosen card in your hand becomes a Joker. Only you learn
      whether it took.
  - Key: item.joker_card.joker
    Value: GOT A JOKER
  - Key: item.joker_card.failed
    Value: NO JOKER
  - Key: item.lock_fold.name
    Value: Lock
  - Key: item.lock_fold.description
    Value: Nobody can fold on the next street, you included.
  - Key: item.lock_fold.notice
    Value: LOCKED FOLD
  - Key: item.mushroom_dose.name
    Value: Spike
  - Key: item.mushroom_dose.description
    Value: A chosen player's next 2 mushrooms either do nothing or hit twice as hard,
      50/50.
  - Key: item.mushroom_dose.notice
    Value: SPIKED
  - Key: item.mushroom_dose.nullified
    Value: EMPTIED {0} CAPS OF
  - Key: item.mushroom_dose.doubled
    Value: DOUBLED {0} CAPS OF
  - Key: item.mushroom_dose.prompt
    Value: POINT AT WHOSE MUSHROOMS YOU SPIKE
  - Key: item.mutual_reveal.name
    Value: Show Together
  - Key: item.mutual_reveal.description
    Value: You and a player you pick each turn one card face up for the whole table
      until the hand ends. They choose which of theirs.
  - Key: item.mutual_reveal.notice
    Value: SHOWS WITH
  - Key: item.mutual_reveal.prompt_own
    Value: POINT AT THE CARD YOU WILL SHOW
  - Key: item.mutual_reveal.prompt_player
    Value: POINT AT WHO SHOWS ONE WITH YOU
  - Key: item.mutual_reveal.response
    Value: 'WANTS YOU TO SHOW A CARD: POINT AT ONE'
  - Key: item.pair_lock_fold.name
    Value: Chained
  - Key: item.pair_lock_fold.description
    Value: You and a chosen player cannot fold on the next street.
  - Key: item.pair_lock_fold.notice
    Value: CHAINED
  - Key: item.pair_lock_items.name
    Value: No Items
  - Key: item.pair_lock_items.description
    Value: You and a chosen player cannot play items on the next street.
  - Key: item.pair_lock_items.notice
    Value: BLOCKED ITEMS OF
  - Key: item.pair_lock.prompt
    Value: POINT AT WHO IS LOCKED WITH YOU
  - Key: item.peek_board.name
    Value: Scry
  - Key: item.peek_board.description
    Value: See one board card before it is turned. You cannot fold this street.
  - Key: item.peek_board.notice
    Value: PEEKED BOARD
  - Key: item.peek_board_main.description
    Value: See the last board card before it is turned. You cannot fold this street.
  - Key: item.peek_hand.name
    Value: Peek
  - Key: item.peek_hand.description
    Value: See one card of a player still in the hand. They are told which card you
      saw.
  - Key: item.peek_hand.notice
    Value: PEEKED AT
  - Key: item.peek_hand.private
    Value: SAW YOUR {0}
  - Key: item.place_on_board.name
    Value: Lay Down
  - Key: item.place_on_board.description
    Value: Lay one of your cards face up on the board for everyone, and draw a new
      card from the deck in its place.
  - Key: item.place_on_board.notice
    Value: LAID A CARD
  - Key: item.place_on_board.prompt
    Value: POINT AT THE CARD YOU LAY ON THE BOARD
  - Key: item.raise_stakes.name
    Value: Raise
  - Key: item.raise_stakes.description
    Value: Every bet on the next street puts up one more cap, yours included.
  - Key: item.raise_stakes.notice
    Value: RAISED STAKES
  - Key: item.random_suit.name
    Value: Repaint
  - Key: item.random_suit.description
    Value: One of your cards keeps its value and takes a random other suit.
  - Key: item.random_suit.notice
    Value: REPAINTED
  - Key: item.random_suit.prompt
    Value: POINT AT THE CARD TO CHANGE
  - Key: item.rate_shift.name
    Value: Rate Shift
  - Key: item.rate_shift.description
    Value: 'Choose a player: their death rate goes up or down by 20, at random.'
  - Key: item.rate_shift.raised
    Value: +{0} DOSE TO
  - Key: item.rate_shift.lowered
    Value: -{0} DOSE TO
  - Key: item.rate_shift.prompt
    Value: POINT AT WHOSE DOSE YOU SHAKE
  - Key: item.shared_roll.name
    Value: Shared Roll
  - Key: item.shared_roll.description
    Value: You and a player you choose each roll against your own death rate, at
      the same time.
  - Key: item.shared_roll.notice
    Value: ROLLED WITH
  - Key: item.shared_roll.prompt
    Value: POINT AT WHO ROLLS WITH YOU
  - Key: item.swap_board.name
    Value: Board Swap
  - Key: item.swap_board.description
    Value: A face-down board card is turned up for everyone, then traded with one
      of your cards, which stays face up on the board.
  - Key: item.swap_board.notice
    Value: SWAPPED BOARD
  - Key: item.swap_board.prompt
    Value: POINT AT THE CARD YOU PUT ON THE BOARD
  - Key: item.swap_hand.name
    Value: Swap
  - Key: item.swap_hand.description
    Value: Trade one of your cards with a player still in the hand. They choose which
      of theirs to give.
  - Key: item.swap_hand.notice
    Value: SWAPPED WITH
  - Key: item.swap_hand.prompt_own
    Value: POINT AT THE CARD YOU GIVE
  - Key: item.swap_hand.prompt_player
    Value: POINT AT WHO YOU SWAP WITH
  - Key: item.swap_hand.response
    Value: swaps a card with you - choose one to swap
  - Key: item.table_reveal.name
    Value: Exposure
  - Key: item.table_reveal.description
    Value: Every player still in the hand shows one random card to the whole table
      this street.
  - Key: item.table_reveal.notice
    Value: EXPOSED ALL
